{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52009","headline":"赠薛学士方士 · 王绩","name":"赠薛学士方士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔岁寻周孔，今春访老庄。\n途经丹水岸，路出白云乡。\n窈窕开皇道，深沉指太方。\n物情争逐鹿，人事各亡羊。\n月明看桂树，日下觅扶桑。\n寄语悠悠者，谁知此路长。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52009.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52009","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}